  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu In-Country Short Term Training 2022: Counselling, Plumbing, Leadership and Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to promote safer communities with better access to essential services, improved confidence in governance institutions, and increased institutional capacity and capability in targeted areas of the public sector through the provision of short term training courses in Vanuatu:
&lt;ol&gt;  &lt;li&gt;a Level 4 Certificate in counselling,&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Leadership and management training for senior public servants,&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;a Level 2 Certificate in plumbing.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
